      "message": "Note that there is a CRC + tag we place at address 0xFFFFFF0x on SPI, as required by the mec1322 ROM. I think this can fail if we are unlucky and write 0xea there.\n\nCan you measure the execution time of this code in the non-fail case? I\u0027m considering to add a size paramater to a structure somewhere for easy access.",
